  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-89746",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "Remember that for continuous random variables, it doesn't matter whether or not we include the endpoints of the interval. So we can perform this computation as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(5\\le X\\le 8) & =P(5<X\\le 8) \\\\  & =P(X\\le 8)-P(X\\le 5) \\\\  & =F(8)-F(5) \\\\  & =1-{e}^{-48}-(1-{e}^{-30}) \\\\  & ={e}^{-30}-{e}^{-48}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
